1
00:00:00,268 --> 00:00:01,598
(Howard:)I have an idea.

2
00:00:01,604 --> 00:00:04,374
(Howard:)What if we put a post
on Craigslist that says:

3
00:00:04,373 --> 00:00:07,273
"World-class Caltech physicist
seeking girlfriend.

4
00:00:07,276 --> 00:00:08,606
"If interested,

5
00:00:08,611 --> 00:00:11,911
(Howard:)solve the following puzzles
for a chance to meet him."

6
00:00:11,914 --> 00:00:13,614
(Sheldon:)Oh, we'll make the puzzles
extremely challenging

7
00:00:13,616 --> 00:00:15,646
(Sheldon:)to eliminate
unworthy candidates.

8
00:00:15,651 --> 00:00:18,021
(Raj:)Oh, we could set it up
like a scavenger hunt where

9
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:20,860
(Raj:)the last puzzle gives the winner
Sheldon's contact information.

10
00:00:20,857 --> 00:00:23,287
(Howard:)Well, this is actually an
interesting social experiment.

11
00:00:23,292 --> 00:00:25,162
(Raj:)I'm a little jealous of the
people who get to do it.

12
00:00:25,161 --> 00:00:26,161
(Howard:)Me, too.

13
00:00:26,162 --> 00:00:27,992
(Howard:)And we've seen the prize.

14
00:00:32,033 --> 00:00:34,333
(Leonard:)I don't understand why we're
leaving so early for the movie.

15
00:00:34,337 --> 00:00:36,537
(Penny:)Oh, I forgot to tell you...
we're gonna meet up

16
00:00:36,539 --> 00:00:38,669
(Penny:)with Bernadette to spy
on Amy and her date.

17
00:00:38,689 --> 00:00:39,409
(Sheldon:)What?

18
00:00:39,408 --> 00:00:40,978
(Leonard:)I don't want to do that.

19
00:00:40,977 --> 00:00:42,777
(Penny:)What, and you think I
want to see a documentary

20
00:00:42,778 --> 00:00:44,748
about aluminum can
recycling?

21
00:00:44,747 --> 00:00:46,147
(Leonard:)This is the movie

22
00:00:46,148 --> 00:00:49,088
(Leonard:)Big Soda doesn't
want you to see.

23
00:00:49,085 --> 00:00:52,555
(Penny:)No, it's the movie your wife
doesn't want you to see.

24
00:00:53,421 --> 00:00:54,891
(Leonard:)So you're actually okay

25
00:00:54,891 --> 00:00:56,821
(Leonard:)with invading
your friend's privacy?

26
00:00:56,826 --> 00:00:59,156
(Penny:)You're not curious
who she's out with?

